  "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/mens-college-basketball/breaking-news/article/high-point-coach-flynn-clayman-rails-against-mid-major-schedule-disparity-after-ncaa-tournament-upset-of-wisconsin-nobody-would-play-us-225155414.html",
